\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. God save our gracious Queen;
\par Long live our noble Queen;
\par God save the Queen!
\par Send her victorious,
\par Happy and glorious,
\par Long to reign over us:
\par God save the Queen!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thy choicest gifts in store
\par On her be pleased to pour;
\par Long may she reign;
\par May she defend our laws,
\par And ever give us cause
\par To sing with heart and voice,
\par God save the Queen!\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

